WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.958
Step 1: Open Home’s Invoice scanner and choose Take photo or Upload invoice. PDF, JPEG, PNG and WebP uploads automatically use OpStack intelligence when it is enabled and permitted.

2
00:00:09.958 --> 00:00:23.333
Step 2: Expand Invoice details and check the supplier. Use Choose supplier to search your company’s saved suppliers and correct a wrong scan, or edit the name directly. Check the invoice number, date, subtotal, GST and total against the original.

3
00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:29.333
Step 3: Check the bundle week, which can be changed independently of the invoice date.

4
00:00:29.333 --> 00:00:35.333
Step 4: Review any proposed stock price changes, then choose Save invoice or Confirm price updates.

5
00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:48.417
Step 5: Open Weekly bundles, expand the saved week and choose Download bundle for one ZIP of its original images and PDFs. Open an individual invoice to correct details, move it, download its original or delete it with confirmation.
